<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka EFESO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">EFESO</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda kuli vaka Efeso vausonekele ha ntsimbu imo na mukanda ua vaka Kolose ngue mu mukati ka 60-62 AD. Muka kusoneka na</para>
  <para style="io1">Liambulula vavenia kupua Paulu (1:1). Vaka kulilongesa cikuma ha cuma cimo vanatava nguavo Paulu ikeye uasonekele Efeso cipue ngoco ou mukanda kuuesi na cihindu ca vavenia cije ciuaniua kuva ka Kolose. Muafua hacifua eci camoneka ngue vausonekele linga uzenguluke mu vikungulukilo vimo vili Munganda. Paulu atumbula naua nguendi uakele mu kamenga omo uasonekele mukanda (3:1, 4:1, 6:20). Paulu uahanene mukanda kuli Tatikikase kuya nauo ha vungenzi vuendi kukamona cikungulukilo caku Efeso (6:21-22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso yapuile Nganda yakama ya vaka Loma hhakati kavinganda via vindende ca muhela mu Asiya. Efeso ye vuikile cikuma muafua vatungile cihela cakama ca kulemesela Kamponia ua va Ngelengu ua mpuevo Atamisi (Vilinga 19:23-31). Cikungulukilo ca Efeso caputukile vuino ha kutualelelaho ca hilukilile munima (Kusolola 2:1-7.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu ali nakulumbununa ha mbazuvuila ya kulivanga ya mukanda ou omo muje Njambi ua hanguile vantu vendi na kuvasambuesa ku vupi vuavo kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu. Ali nakusetekesa cikungulukilo ku muvila na njivo. Kilistu ikeye mutue ua muvila na cisimi cakama ca njivo. Mu mbazuvuila ya mucivali ya mukanda Paulu ahana mashiko muvanapande kuyoya muvu Yesu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kulumbununa viuma vili mu mukanda:</para>
  <para style="io1">1.1-2 Paulu aliambulula vavenia na kumeneka va Efeso.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaha alumbununa vu sepa vua cikungulukilo na Kilistu (1:33; 21).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaha Paulu ali nakusoneka ha ngila vanapande kuyoyelamo vaka Yesu (4:16-20).</para>
  <para style="io1">Hakumanusula Paulu ahandeka amo mezi akushoka (6:21-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mitende kuhuminina kuli Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Paulu, kanganda ua Kilistu Yesu ku cizango ca Njambi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Kuli vantu va Njambi vakulela vaje naua vapua vakukonkama muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Njambi tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu vamihane ngozi na ciyulo.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vikuisulo muli Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Tulemeseni Njambi ikeye Njambi ya Muene yetu Yesu Kilistu kaha ikeye naua ishe. Omuo mukulipandakana kuetu na Kilistu natukuisula navikuisulo vioshe via Cimbembesi mu vihela via muilu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Tele kanda vapange mavu, Njambi uatuhanguile laja tupue vendi muli Kilistu, tupue vakulela na kujeneka mulonga ku mesho endi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Omuo cizango cendi, <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Njambi uayonguelele kulutue ngeci kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu akatupuisa kupua vana vendi. Eci capuile cakumulema na vutumbe vuendi vavenia. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Nkuma tulemeseni Njambi ou natumuesa ngozi yendi yakama cikuma muafua ya munendi yazema. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Mu maninga a Yesu Kilistu tunapatuka na kutusambesa ku vupi vuetu, ovu vukevo vukama vua ngozi yendi yakama cikuma-kuma. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Njambi natuhana ngozi museteko yakama! Mukuendelela na mana oshe na mukutantekeya kuoshe. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Njambi ualingile vije uatumbuile kulinga kulutue. Uatusholuelele vutumbe vuendi vua vushueke vuasinganiekele kumanesa kuhitila muli Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Vutumbe ovu vuje Njambi aka vumanesa omo nga ntsimbu ya cili inapuho, akakungulula vioshe via muilu nevi via ha mavu muli Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Vioshe viuma Njambi ualingile kuya navutumbe vuendi. Njambi uatuhanguile kupua tuvantu vendi kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu. Ovu vukevuo vutumbe vuendi vua tumbile hume ha katete. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Yetu vakulivanga tuakala na likulahelo muli Kilistu tulemeseni vumpau vua Njambi.<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Neni naua muapuile mu vantu va Njambi omo muazivile lizi lia vusunga, vimpande viacili vije viaminehelele kuovoka. Muakulahelele muli Kilistu, Kaha Njambi namihaka cizivukiso cakupua muvendi hakumihana Cimbembesi cakulela uje uamikulahesele. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Cimbembesi cikeco cinatulingisa cili vene tukasuana vije Njambi nakulahesa vantu vendi, kaha tunasimpi ngeci Njambi a kapatula vantu vendi. Tulemeseni vumpau vuendi!<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo lia Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Muafua ya vioshe evi Njambi vianamilingila hume njevuile kukutsiliela kueni muli Muene Yesu, na cizango ceni kuli voshe vantu va Njambi, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>kunjalikelele kutsatsela kuli Njambi omuo yeni. Ntsimbu yoshe njikamilombelela. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Njili nakutualeleho kulomba kuli Njambi ya Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, ishe ya ku vumpau amihane Cimbembesi ca mana na ca kusholola linga mutantekeye Njambi muacili. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Njili na kulomba kuli Njambi linga amihane ceke ca kutantekeya likulahelo lije liva namisanena na vumpau vuakama vua vufuko vuva kasuana vantu vendi. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Naua njikalombo nguange mutantekeye nzili yendi yakama kuli yetu vaka kutsiliela. Ije nzili ipanga muli yetu inapu ngue nzili yakama ije <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>uapangesele omo uasanguile Kilistu ku vatsi nakumutumbika ku livoko liendi lia cilio mu lifuti lia muilu. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Kuje Kilistu ikeye muka kushika helu lia voshe vaka kushika muilu, vaka mpoko yakama na vaka nzili na vimiene voshe, ikeye ali na lizina lili helu lia mazina oshe a mpoko ali hano vene na aje akejaho. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Njambi nahana nzili yoshe muli Kilistu nakumupuisa mutue ua vioshe mu cikungulukilo. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Cikungulukilo cinapu muvila ua Kilistu, na cikungulukilo cinashulu ikeye na ikeye nashulisisa vioshe.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kuhuma ku kutsa kuya ku muono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Laja muapuile muvatsi ku Cimbembesi omuo ku muononokele Njambi, nakulinga vupi. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Ha ntsimbu ije muakavangeyele vingila via vupi via muno mu lifuti, muononokele suana ua muvukambuila ikeye Cimbembesi ou ali na kutuamenena vantu vaje kuvesi nakuononoka Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Mua vusunga vene tuva voshe tuafuile ngue vakevo ha ntsimbu imo, kaha tuayoyele vene ngue kucisemua ca mashungu etu a vuntu. Tualingile vije vuntu vuetu na visinganieka via vuntu viakele nakutonda. Muafua kucisemua cetu ca vuntu ngue vantu voshe, tuapandele kuyanda ku vukalu vua Njambi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Vuno honi Njambi uapua ua cikeketima cikuma, muafua ha cizango cendi kuli yetu capua cakama cikuma. <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>Omo tuatsile ku vupi vuetu ku Cimbembesi, Njambi uatunehele ku muono na Kilistu. Munovoka ha ngozi ya Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Hakukala kuetu muli Kilistu Yesu, Njambi uatusanguile mu Cimbembesi hamo nendi ngeci tukayule hamo nendi muilu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Ualingile evi kupua cimueso kuli voshe ha vintsimbu vioshe na vije vikejako ha kumuesa vukama vua cikeketima cendi cije kutuasa kuseteka na kavumbi kaje katumuesele muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Munovoka muafua ngozi ya Njambi kuhitila mulikulahelo. Eci keti ngue ha vilinga vieni kuahi, vuno honi cinapu vuana vua Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Njambi kamiovuele ha vilinga vieni. Muafua yaevi kukuesi visinganieka linga muntu umo alishashe. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Yetu tunapu vakutanga kuli Njambi, kaha hakukala kuetu muli Kilistu Yesu uatutangelele yetu kulinga vipangi viacili, vije uatu vuaheselelevio kulutue ngeci vene tuyoye mu cifua eci vene.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vumo muli Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Singaniekeni ha ntsimbu imo yeni keti mu Vayunda kucisemua, vaje vamisana nguavo “Vakakujeneka kulovoka” ngue ku futisi ya Vayunda, vaje valitumbula nguavo “vaka kulovoka” eci cikalingika kumivila ua muntu namavoko. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Ha ntsimbu ije muahangunukile kuli Kilistu. Muapuile muvangezi kumuakundamene ku vantu va Isaleli vaje Njambi uahanguile. Kumuakele na mutambela mu matavasano, aje emanene ha vikulaheso via Njambi kuli vantu vendi, kaha yeni muayoyele hano ha mavu kua kuhona likulahelo na kujeneka Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Muakele kulahako na Njambi ha ntsimbu imo. Vuno honi vanaminehe hayehi muli Kilistu kuhitila mu maninga endi. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Omo Kilistu natunehela ciyulo hakupua Vayunda na vaje keti Vayunda kupua umolika. Uahanene muvila uendi kupua cikombelo, ca kuvujula civumbe cije cava hangunuine na kuvapuisa vitozi. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Omo uatsile uatupuisile kulikela kukavangeya mashiko a Vayunda hamo nakushika kualio na futisi yalio linga yetu tuovoke. Ualingile eci ngeci vivunga vivali vipue civunga cimolika, linga kukale ciyulo. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Kuhitila ha kutsa cendi ha cilindakano Kilistu uanongesele vizindo viavo. Kuhitila ha cilindakano napandakana vivunga vivali nakuvipuisa muvila umolika nakuvineha hamo na Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Kilistu uezile nakuambulula muzimbu ua cili ua ciyulo kuli voshe, kuli yeni keti Vayunda vaje vakele kulahako na Njambi na kuli Vayunda vaje vakele kuyehi na Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Muli Kilistu yetu voshe, Vayunda na vaje keti Vayunda, tuasa kuija ku mesho a Tate mu Cimbembesi ca Njambi.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Nankuma, yeni keti Vayunda kumuapuile honi naua vakakuija, yenihoni munapu mu vandambo hamo na vantu va Njambi, yenihoni munapu vantu va ntanga ya Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Neni naua vanamitungu ha luvula lua tunganda na tunanguizi va Njambi, cisimi caseho cikuma ca mu mbango cikeco Kilistu Yesu vavenia. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Ikeye muka kukuatela njivo yoshe hamolika na kuyikolesa na kuyipuisa njivo yakulela ya Muene. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Muli Yesu yeni vana mitungu mumo na vakueni veka ngeci mupue muhela ua Njambi uakayoyela kuhitila hali Cimbembesi cendi.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Vipangi via Paulu kuli vaje keti Vayunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Kuya kuviuma vije vianapanga Njambi, yange Paulu njili nakumilombelela. Njili mu kamenga muafua ha vipangi via Kilistu Yesu hali yeni keti Vayunda. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Mua vusunga vene yeni muazivuka ngueni Njambi mu kavumbi kendi nanjihana vipangi evi via kuambulula muzimbu ua cili. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Njambi uajomboluele vutumbe vuendi vua kushueka nakuvusholola kuli yange. Njasoneka laja muvundende ha cuma eci. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Kaha nga mutanda vije vinjasoneka muhasa kuvuisisa muje munjikevuisisa vishueka via hali Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Mu vintsimbu via hanima vantu kuva valekele vishueka evi vuno honi Njambi navisholola alolo hali Cimbembesi cendi kuli tunganda na tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi vaje vahanguile. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Cishueka eci, capuile ngeci hali lizi lia muzimbu uacili, vaje keti Vayunda hano honi vali namutambela hamo na Vayunda mu vikuisulo via Njambi vakevo vanapu muvila umo, na kuli pangazela mu cikulaheso ca Njambi cije ca pangele muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Njambi uanjihanene vuana vuakama vua kuambulula mu muzimbu uacili. Ualingile eci kuhitila mu nzili yendi ilina kupanga muli yange. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Yange njapua nji uamundende ku hiana voshe vantu va Njambi, vuno honi Njambi ua nji hanene vipangi viacili viakuambulula muzimbu uacili kuli vaje keti Vayunda ua vufuko vua Kilistu vuje vua kukomokesa. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Uanjihanene naua vipangi via kumuesa vantu voshe vutumbe vua vishueka viendi muje mu vukalingiua. Njambi ikeye samatanga ua vioshe, uashuekele vushueka vuendi ku miaka yoshe ya kunima. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Visinganieka viendi hali evi vioshe viapuile kupangesa cikungulukilo kumuesa vaka kusuana na vaka nzili mu lifuti lia muilu muje vati mana endi akalanao mu vioshe. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Evi vikevio Njambi uasinganiekele hume ha katete kaha uavimanusuile kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu Muene yetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Muafua Kilistu na likulahelo lietu muli ikeye tuasahoni kuija mu kusimpa na kutsiliela muli Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Nankuma, njimilomba nguange keti muzeye ha tuyando tuange njili naku uana omuo ha liyeni. Muafuila kuziva kalemeso ngueni njalihana kuyandela viuma evi muafua hali yeni.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ca Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Muafua ha vutumbe vuakama vua Njambi nja ntsikamene ha mavuli ange naku milombelela ku mesho a tate. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Ikeye ishe ua ntanga yoshe ya hano ha muilu na mavu. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Njilomba kuli Njambi ha vufuko vua vumpau vuendi ngeci amihane nzili hali Cimbembesi cendi linga mukale na nzili mukati ka mitima yeni. <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Njilomba nguange Kilistu ayoye mu mitima yeni ha kutsiliela. Kaha naua njilomba nguange mu shalave mizi mu cizango na luvula lueni lupue mu cizango. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Mungila eyi yeni hamolika na vantu va Njambi voshe mukakala na nzili ya kutantekeya muacili vukama vua cizango ca Kilistu ca kuhona kuhua. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Njilomba nguange mutantekeye cizango cendi cipue vene ku muhasa kucitantekeya muacili. Kaha nga mutantekeya cizango cendi mukashulilila na cifua ca Njambi.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Njambi asa kulinga vije viuma via kuhiana cikuma mu nzili ili nakupanga muli yetu. Ahasa kupanga mu kuhiana vije vituasa kumulomba cipue kuhiana vije vituasa kusinganieka. <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Kuli Njambi kukale vumpau mu cikungulikilo na muli Kilistu Yesu ku ntsimbu yoshe na ku miaka yayaye Ameni.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kulikuta mu muvila ua Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Njili mu kamenga muafua ya kupangela Muene. Njimilomba muyoye muvu yoye vuaku fuilamo vua vantu vaje Njambi nahangula kupua vendi. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Ntsimbu yoshe pueni vaka kuononoka na kulikehesa naku vandamena. Mueseni kulikonekela umo na mukuavo mu cizango. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Koleseni kutulika muacili vumolika vuana mihana yeni Cimbembesi ca Njambi mu kukala mu ciyulo cije cinamikutu hamolika. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Muvavoshe munapu mbazuvuila ya muvila umolika. Kuli Cimbembesi ca kulela cimolika. Ngue Njambi muanamihana likulahelo limolika muamisanene. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Kuli Muene umolika na lutsilielo lumolika na kumbuitika cimolika. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Kuli Njambi umo ikeye ishe ya voshe, Muene ua voshe, uapanga mu voshe kaha ali mu voshe.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Umo na umo hali yetu voshe natambula vuana vua cili kuesekesa ku vije Kilisitu uahanguile kupangezela. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Omo ikeye uaile ku cihela cilahako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Uambate vitozi vavengi hamo nendi vaje vakuate</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Nakuhana mavuana kuli vantu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Kaha naua “Ikeye uaile ku cihela cilahako” cinalumbunuka vika? Cinalumbunuka ngeci ha kulivanga uezile muintsi lia mavu akulova. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Uje uezile muitsi lia mavu, ikeye umolika uaile muilu lia melu oshe linga ashulise mavu oshe na ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Uapuile ikeye ua hanene vuana, uemikile vamo tunganda, vamo kupua tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi, vamo vapue vaka kuambulula muzimbu uacili, vamo vapue tuniungi vamo valongisi. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Ualingile evi muku vuahesela vantu va Njambi vamupangele, mukutunga muvila ua Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Eci cikatualelelaho noho tuva voshe tukapua vantu vamolika muafua mulukulahelo luetu muli Muna Njambi muafua tuvavoshe tumutantekeya. Tukapua vantu vakukola mulukulahelo na kuheta haseteko ya kumanesela ya Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Kaha kutukapuho ngue tuvanike naua. Kutukatavesa vaka makuli kutukuisa na vilongesa via makuli vije viakufua ngue mankimba na mpunzi vije vitupekumuna. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Vuno honi hakuhandeka vusunga na cizango, tukakola mu vingila vioshe ngue Kilistu uje napu mutue. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Hali ikeye viluo via muvila vioshe vinali nungakana ha molika kaha muvila uoshe unalikuata hamo mu manunga. Muvila unakolo na kulitunga ukeuo vavenia mu cizango kuya ku mbazuvuila mu ikapangelamo cipangi cayo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muono ua muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Mu lizina lia Muene, njiminangula keti muyoye ngue vantu vaje kuvazivuka Njambi, vaje viyongola viavo viapua viangoco, <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>kaha kuvuisisa kuavo cili mu milima. Vakevo ku vesi na mutambela mu muono uje uakahana Njambi omuo vakevo vali kunzimba na mu kukaluuisa mitima yavo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Vakevo kuvesi nashuamua yahi. Vana liecelela na kulinga viuma via vupangala kaha vali na lishungu lia kutualelelaho kulinga viuma evi.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Muje keti mukemo mu muali longeselelemo hali Kilistu <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Mua vusunga yeni muaziva laja via hali ikeye kaha ha kupua vaka kumukava vamilongesele vusunga vuje vuli muli Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Vamilongesele kuseza vuntu vueni vua laja vuje vuakele naku miyoyesa muje mu muakele. Vuje vuntu vueni vua laja vavunongesele ha mashungu eni aje amakuli. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Visinganieka vieni vinapande kupua via viha. <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Kaha munapande kuzala vuntu vua vuha vuje vuva napanga mu cifua ca Njambi. Ovu vuntu vua vuha vunapu vua vusunga cikuma na kulela.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Nankuma keti muhandeke makuli naua! Muntu na muntu napande kuhandeka vusunga kuli mukuavo omuo yetu tuva voshe tunapu vilio via mu muvila ua Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Nga muniengua keti mutave kuniengua kueni cimituale ku vupi. Kaha keti mutokese litangua mu kuniengua lika kuahi. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Keti mutave kuhana Satana muhela. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Muntu uje uevile kapandele naua kuiva vuno honi aputuka kuononoka na kupanga cikuma linga akale nacimo ca kukuasa vihutu.<verse eid="EPH 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Keti mulikuasese mezi akupihia omuo muhandeka, vuno honi likuaseseni mezi acili aje asakutunga vantu kuya kuli vivana honoua ngeci vioshe vimuhandeka vikapue viacili kuli vaje voshe vamitolilila. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Kaha keti munienguese Cimbembesi ca kulela ca Njambi. Omuo Cimbembesi ca kulela ca Njambi capua cimueso ca Njambi ca cakumuesa ngue muakundama kuli ikeye. Cimbembesi ca kulela cinapu lishimbikaya ngeci omo litangua lia kumanusuila likeja kaha Njambi aka mipatula. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Humiseni kushasha kuoshe na vutenu. Keti kukale na kulicokota cipue kulituka umo na mukuavo na matumbe amapi mukati keni. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Vuno honi pueni vaka ngozi na vaka cikeketima kuli umo na mukuavo. Lisambueseni umo na mukuavo ngue muana misambuesa Njambi muli Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyoya mu ceke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Muapande kutemunuisa Njambi omuo muapua vana vendi vakumuya ku mutima. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Yoyeni vuyoye vua cizango ngue omo Kilistu ua tuzangele na kulilambuila ikeye vavenia hali yetu ngue nkombelo ya luengo luacili.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Keti muhane vakueni visinganieka via kuhandeka ngue kuli vupangala, viuma via mazilo na lizangamena hhakati keni, muafua viuma evi keti viacili kupanga ku vantu va Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Ku muapandele kuhandeka mezi ashuamua cipue a vulema ku vantu cipue kuhandeka likehelela lia mazilo. Evi keti viuma viacili kuli yeni vuno honi munapande lika kusantsela Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Muazivuka ngueni uoshe alinga vupangala, cipue muntu ua mazilo cipue ua lizangamena kakasuana ku Vumuene vua Kilistu novu vua Njambi. Uoshe alinga lizangamena alemesa tumponia.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Keti mutave umo amikuise na mezi a mupulungua, omuo ha viuma evi vukalu vua Njambi vukakala hali vaje vaka kujeneka kuononoka. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Keti mulipandakane na vije viva kalingi vantu vacifua canga cije <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Ha ntsimbu imo muakele mu milima vuno honi omuo munapu mu vantu va Muene muli mu ceke. Munapande kuyoya ngue vantu vali mu ceke. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Ceke cikeco cikakuneha kuteja kuakama ca kusungama na vusunga. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Uaneni vije vivuahelesa Muene. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Keti muambateko mutambela ku viuma viangoco vije viva kalingi vantu, viuma vije vinakundama ku milima vuno honi vishololeni ku ceke. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Cinapu ca shuamua cipue kuhandeka viuma vije vivalinga mu vushueke. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Omo viuma vioshe visholoka mu ceke, ambahoni vusunga vuacifua cavio vusholoka, <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>muafua omo ceke cisholola cuma cije cuma cikeco cipua ceke. Omu mukemuo vahandeka nguavio:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Eni vaka kukosa hindukeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Sangukeni muhume kuvutsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Kaha Kilistu akatuila ceke cendi hali yeni.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Nankuma, zangameni mu mulina kuyoya. Keti muyoye ngue vaka kuhona mana vuno honi ngue vaka mana. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Pangeseni muacili vintsimbu vije mulinavio, omo matangua ano anapu a mapi <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Keti mupue ngue vilema, vuno honi uvuisiseni vije viazanga Muene ngeci mucipange.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Keti mupende na viniu vije viasa kumipihisa, vuno honi taveni Cimbembesi ca Njambi cimipangese. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Handekeni umo na nukuavo na mezi a miaso ya Visamo na miaso yakulela. Imbeni miaso na kushangazala kuli Muene mu mitima yeni. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Ntsimbu yoshe santseleni kuli Njambi tatetu mu viuma vioshe mu lizina lia Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Katumamesi kava kakuambata na vaka ku shomboka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Lihaneni umo na mukuavo muafua muka singimika Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Yeni Vampuevo lihaneni kuli vamala veni, ngue kuli Muene. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Yala ali na mpoko hali mpuevo yendi, ngue omo Kilistu ali na mpoko ha cikungulukilo. Kilistu vavenia ikeye muyoyesi ua cikungulukilo uje ukeuo muvila uendi. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Vampuevo vanapande kulihana kuli vamala vavo mu vioshe, ngue cikungulukilo mucikalihana kuli Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Eni vamala, zangeni vampuevo veni ngue Kilistu mua zangela cikungulukilo, kaha uahanene muono uendi hali cikeco. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Ualingile evi mukulelesa cikungulukilo ha kucikusha mu mema na mezi a Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Uatsile kulinga cikungulukilo cimane ku mesho endi mu vumpau vuaco vuoshe, kuakuhona katoma cipue kapenga kamo cipue ceka ha viuma evi, vuno honi mukulela cipue mukuhona mulonga. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Mukemuo naua vamala vanapande kuzanga vampuevo vavo ngue muva kazange mivila yavo vavenia. Yala uje azanga mpuevo yendi alizanga ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Naumo uahi uazinda muvila uendi vavenia. Vuno honi aulisa naku ulela ngue Kilistu vene muakalingi ku cikungulokilo, <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>omuo tunapu vilio via muvila uendi. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Mukemo yala akaseza ishe na ina naku lipandakana na mpuevo yendi, kaha voshe vavali vakapua muvila umo.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Kuli cisinkiko cakulova ca vusunga mu visoneka evi, njili nakuhandeka hali via Kilistu na cikungulukilo. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Vuno honi cinenika yeni naua, yala uoshe napande kuzanga mpuevo yendi ngue mualizanga ikeye vavenia, kaha mpuevo uoshe napande kusingimika yala liendi.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Vana na visemi viavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Yeni vana ononokeni kuli visemi veni muafua muakundama kuli Muene. Eci cikeco cuma cacili kucilinga. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Singimika isho na noko.” Eli likelio Lishiko lia kulivanga muje lije Njambi uakulaheselemo cuma cimo. <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>Eci cikeco cakulahesele, “Nga usingimika visemi vove viuma vioshe vipua viacili kuli yove mu vuyoye vuove kaha ukayoya ntsimbu yakama muno mu lifuti.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Eni visemi keti muyandese vana veni. Omo muvalela valongeseni mu vilongesa via Muene.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vangamba na Vamiene vavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Eni vangamba, ononokeni vamiene veni va hano ha lifuti. Lingeni eci na mitima ya kasingimiko kavusunga, ngue vene mulina kupangela Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Lingeni eci keti omo valina kumitalelela, muafua mutonda kuvuahesa ku mitima yavo, vuno honi na mitima yeni yoshe lingeni vije viatonda Njambi, ngue vangamba va Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Lingeni vipangi vieni via vungamba nakujolela, ngue mulina kupangela Muene, keti ngue vantu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Zivukeni ngueni Muene akafueta muntu na muntu, cipue ngamba cipue ua kupatuka, ha vipangi viendi viacili viali.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Neni vamiene, lingeni naua cuma cimo kuli vangamba veni muku vapangesa muacili, keti muva teuese. Zivukeni ngueni yeni na vangamba veni muvavoshe muli kuli Muene umolika ali muilu, uje kakele nacivembulu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vitua via Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Hakumanusuila, koleseni muli Muene na mu nzili ya vukama vuendi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Zaleni ku vitua vioshe vije Njambi nami hana linga cimiasiuise mukukolesa mukulua na matumbe a Satana. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Yetu kutuesi na kuluisa vantu vuno honi tuli na kulua na vimbembesi via nzili via ha vuntanga ntanga, vaka kushika, vaka mpoko na vinzili ya ha mavu ya milima. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Hacuma eci zaleni vitua vioshe via Njambi, kaha omo litangua lia vupi likeja cika miasiuisa kuliamena ku citozi kaha cipue muna manusula kuliamena hanga mukemana mbe.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Kaleni na kulivuahesela na vusunga ngue muiva umuna likutilila mu vimbunda. Zaleni kulongua cije cikeco cikapua ngue cuma ca kuohiela ntulo ya ku mivila yeni. <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>Zaleni mu vinkaku vije vinapu ngue ciyulo cije cihuminina ku muzimbu uacili vije vikamikuasa kuimana mbe mu nzita. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Ntsimbu yoshe ambateni lutsilielo ngue ntelo. Hali evi lika mukasa kuzima mivi ya tuhia ije yali na kuasha Satana. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Ambateni kuovoka kupua litepa lieni na lizi lia Njambi ngue mukuale uje uvana mihana ku Cimbembesi. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Lombeleni mu kulinga viuma evi, lombeni vukuasi kuli Njambi. Ntsimbu yoshe lombeleni ngue omo Cimbembesi mu cimituamenena. Mu cifua eci pueni vakuli vuahesela kaha keti muecele. Lombeleni ntsimbu yoshe ha vantu voshe va Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Nange naua munjikundikeko, linga Njambi anjihane mezi acili omo njihandeka linga njambulule na ku simpa na kusholola vushueke vua muzimbu uacili. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Njimu kakuimanena ua Kilistu linga njambulule ou muzimbu uacili cipue vene njili mu kamenga. Lombeleni linga njisimpe mu kuhandeka ngue mucina fuilamo.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vihindu via Kumanesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Njili nakutuma kuli yeni Tatikikase muanetu ituazanga naua ngamba yetu uakulongua mu vipangi via Muene! Akamihana muzimbu uoshe uahali yanga mutantekeye ngueni vati njina hindukilamo <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Omu mukemo njili nakumutuma kuli yeni, linga akamileke vati yetu voshe mutuna hindukila na kukolesa mitima yeni.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Njambi tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu vahane kuli yeni vaka kutsiliela ciyulo na cizango mu kutsiliela. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Cikeketima ca Njambi cikale na voshe vaje vazanga Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu na cizango ca ku miaka yoshe.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
